Chapter: MatchedNoise
  cites Diffusion chapter Pcg64
  cites Diffusion chapter Sampler

 get_matched_noise of Forge's outpainting mk2 (scripts/outpainting_mk_2.py,
 from g-diffuser-bot), in f64 over an H x W x 3 picture of byte / 255 and a
 mask of 0 or 1 (white where it is to be filled).

 The picture's unmasked part scaled by its own maximum, the masked part set
 to the picture's mean, is transformed per channel (fftshift, fft2 with ortho
 normalization, ifftshift) for its magnitudes and phases. Noise is
 default_rng (0).random ((H, W, 3)) blended toward its grey by color
 variation, windowed in frequency by 1 / ((x^2 + 1) (y^2 + 1)) (x over the
 rows and y over the columns, each from -1 to 1 scaled by its side over the
 shorter side), back, forward again, squared in magnitude times the
 picture's magnitude to the noise_q times its phase, back to real, scaled to
 0..1; its masked values matched to the histogram of the picture's unmasked
 values per channel (skimage 0.21 _match_cumulative_cdf: np.unique of each,
 cumulative counts over the size, np.interp), then the picture kept where
 the mask is 0 and clipped to 0..1.

 Every size here is a multiple of 64, therefore even, and fftshift and
 ifftshift are both a roll by half. The FFT is mixed-radix
 decimation in time over a table of the length's roots of unity.

 We say:

Section: Doubles

  md-get : Integer, Integer -> Real
  md-get (a) (i) = bits-to-real (bit-or (bit-and (peek-32 a (i * 8)) #FFFFFFFF) (bit-shl (bit-and (peek-32 a (i * 8 + 4)) #FFFFFFFF) 32))

  md-set : Integer, Integer, Real -> Integer
  md-set (a) (i) (v) = let b = real-to-bits v in let l = poke-32 a (i * 8) (bit-and b #FFFFFFFF) in poke-32 a (i * 8 + 4) (bit-shru b 32)

  md-new : Integer -> Integer
  md-new (n) = alloc-bytes (n * 8)

  md-fill : Integer, Real, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-fill (a) (v) (i) (n) = if i >= n then a else let s = md-set a i v in md-fill a v (i + 1) n

Section: Roots

  Roots = record {
    rt-n : Integer,
    rt-re : Integer,
    rt-im : Integer
  }

 exp (-2 pi i j / n) for j below n.

  md-roots : Integer -> Roots
  md-roots (n) = md-roots-fill n (md-new n) (md-new n) 0

  md-roots-fill : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Roots
  md-roots-fill (n) (re) (im) (j) =
    if j >= n then Roots { rt-n = n, rt-re = re, rt-im = im }
    else let a = 2.0 * dm-pi * real-from-int j / real-from-int n
    in let s = md-set re j (real-cos a) + md-set im j (0.0 - real-sin a)
    in md-roots-fill n re im (j + 1)

  md-least-factor : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-least-factor (n) (p) = if p * p > n then n else if n - n / p * p == 0 then p else md-least-factor n (p + 1)

Section: FFT

 One transform of length n from (ire, iim) at ioff every istride into
 (ore, oim) at ooff contiguous; inv conjugates the roots; tmp holds 2 p.

  md-fft : Roots, Boolean, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-fft (rt) (inv) (ire) (iim) (ioff) (istride) (ore) (oim) (ooff) (n) (tmp) =
    if n == 1 then md-set ore ooff (md-get ire ioff) + md-set oim ooff (md-get iim ioff)
    else let p = md-least-factor n 2
    in let m = n / p
    in let subs = md-fft-subs rt inv ire iim ioff istride ore oim ooff m p 0 tmp
    in md-combine rt inv ore oim ooff n m p 0 tmp

  md-fft-subs : Roots, Boolean, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-fft-subs (rt) (inv) (ire) (iim) (ioff) (istride) (ore) (oim) (ooff) (m) (p) (r) (tmp) =
    if r >= p then 0
    else let s = md-fft rt inv ire iim (ioff + r * istride) (istride * p) ore oim (ooff + r * m) m tmp
    in md-fft-subs rt inv ire iim ioff istride ore oim ooff m p (r + 1) tmp

  md-combine : Roots, Boolean, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-combine (rt) (inv) (ore) (oim) (ooff) (n) (m) (p) (k) (tmp) =
    if k >= m then 0
    else let g = md-gather ore oim ooff m p k 0 tmp
    in let w = md-butterfly rt inv ore oim ooff n m p k 0 tmp
    in md-combine rt inv ore oim ooff n m p (k + 1) tmp

  md-gather : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-gather (ore) (oim) (ooff) (m) (p) (k) (r) (tmp) =
    if r >= p then 0
    else let s = md-set tmp (2 * r) (md-get ore (ooff + r * m + k)) + md-set tmp (2 * r + 1) (md-get oim (ooff + r * m + k))
    in md-gather ore oim ooff m p k (r + 1) tmp

  md-butterfly : Roots, Boolean, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-butterfly (rt) (inv) (ore) (oim) (ooff) (n) (m) (p) (k) (q) (tmp) =
    if q >= p then 0
    else let idx = q * m + k
    in let s = md-set ore (ooff + idx) (md-acc rt inv n p idx 0 tmp True 0.0) + md-set oim (ooff + idx) (md-acc rt inv n p idx 0 tmp False 0.0)
    in md-butterfly rt inv ore oim ooff n m p k (q + 1) tmp

 The real (re) or imaginary part of the sum over r of t_r times the root of
 n to the r idx.

  md-acc : Roots, Boolean, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Boolean, Real -> Real
  md-acc (rt) (inv) (n) (p) (idx) (r) (tmp) (re) (acc) =
    if r >= p then acc
    else let e = r * idx - (r * idx) / n * n
    in let j = e * (rt.rt-n / n)
    in let wr = md-get (rt.rt-re) j
    in let wi0 = md-get (rt.rt-im) j
    in let wi = if inv then 0.0 - wi0 else wi0
    in let tr = md-get tmp (2 * r)
    in let ti = md-get tmp (2 * r + 1)
    in md-acc rt inv n p idx (r + 1) tmp re (acc + (if re then tr * wr - ti * wi else tr * wi + ti * wr))
Section: Planes

 A 2-D transform in place over an H x W plane (re, im): every row, then every
 column, through the line buffers; then ortho normalization.

  Fft2 = record {
    ff-rows : Roots,
    ff-cols : Roots,
    ff-lre : Integer,
    ff-lim : Integer,
    ff-tmp : Integer
  }

  md-fft2-for : Integer, Integer -> Fft2
  md-fft2-for (h) (w) = Fft2 { ff-rows = md-roots w, ff-cols = md-roots h, ff-lre = md-new (if h > w then h else w), ff-lim = md-new (if h > w then h else w), ff-tmp = md-new 128 }

  md-put-line : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-put-line (re) (im) (off) (stride) (lre) (lim) (i) (n) =
    if i >= n then 0
    else let s = md-set re (off + i * stride) (md-get lre i) + md-set im (off + i * stride) (md-get lim i)
    in md-put-line re im off stride lre lim (i + 1) n

  md-lines : Fft2, Boolean, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Boolean, Integer -> Integer
  md-lines (f) (inv) (re) (im) (h) (w) (rows) (k) =
    if k >= (if rows then h else w) then 0
    else let n = if rows then w else h
    in let off = if rows then k * w else k
    in let stride = if rows then 1 else w
    in let a = md-fft (if rows then f.ff-rows else f.ff-cols) inv re im off stride (f.ff-lre) (f.ff-lim) 0 n (f.ff-tmp)
    in let b = md-put-line re im off stride (f.ff-lre) (f.ff-lim) 0 n
    in md-lines f inv re im h w rows (k + 1)

  md-scale : Integer, Integer, Real, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-scale (re) (im) (k) (i) (n) = if i >= n then 0 else let s = md-set re i (md-get re i * k) + md-set im i (md-get im i * k) in md-scale re im k (i + 1) n

 np.fft.fftshift and ifftshift of an even plane: a roll by half each way.

  md-roll : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-roll (re) (im) (h) (w) (dre) (dim) (i) =
    if i >= h * w then 0
    else let y = i / w
    in let x = i - y * w
    in let j = (y + h / 2 - (y + h / 2) / h * h) * w + (x + w / 2 - (x + w / 2) / w * w)
    in let s = md-set dre i (md-get re j) + md-set dim i (md-get im j)
    in md-roll re im h w dre dim (i + 1)

 _fft2 (or _ifft2 when inv) of the plane (re, im), as fresh planes.

  md-shifted-fft2 : Fft2, Boolean, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> List Integer
  md-shifted-fft2 (f) (inv) (re) (im) (h) (w) =
    let n = h * w
    in let are = md-new n
    in let aim = md-new n
    in let r1 = md-roll re im h w are aim 0
    in let t1 = md-lines f inv are aim h w True 0
    in let t2 = md-lines f inv are aim h w False 0
    in let sc = md-scale are aim (1.0 / real-sqrt (real-from-int n)) 0 n
    in let bre = md-new n
    in let bim = md-new n
    in let r2 = md-roll are aim h w bre bim 0
    in [bre, bim]

Section: Noise

  md-plane : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-plane (src) (c) (n) = md-plane-fill src c (md-new n) 0 n

  md-plane-fill : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-plane-fill (src) (c) (dst) (i) (n) = if i >= n then dst else let s = md-set dst i (md-get src (i * 3 + c)) in md-plane-fill src c dst (i + 1) n

  md-draws : Pcg, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-draws (g) (dst) (i) (n) = if i >= n then dst else let s = md-set dst i (pcg-random g) in md-draws g dst (i + 1) n

  md-tint : Integer, Real, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-tint (nz) (cv) (p) (n) =
    if p >= n then nz
    else let g = (md-get nz (p * 3) + md-get nz (p * 3 + 1) + md-get nz (p * 3 + 2)) / 3.0
    in let a = md-set nz (p * 3) (md-get nz (p * 3) * cv + (1.0 - cv) * g)
    in let b = md-set nz (p * 3 + 1) (md-get nz (p * 3 + 1) * cv + (1.0 - cv) * g)
    in let c = md-set nz (p * 3 + 2) (md-get nz (p * 3 + 2) * cv + (1.0 - cv) * g)
    in md-tint nz cv (p + 1) n

  md-window : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Real
  md-window (h) (w) (i) =
    let y = i / w
    in let x = i - y * w
    in let mn = real-from-int (if h < w then h else w)
    in let a = (real-from-int y / real-from-int h * 2.0 - 1.0) * (real-from-int h / mn)
    in let b = (real-from-int x / real-from-int w * 2.0 - 1.0) * (real-from-int w / mn)
    in 1.0 / ((a * a + 1.0) * (b * b + 1.0))

  md-windowed : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-windowed (re) (im) (h) (w) (i) =
    if i >= h * w then 0
    else let k = md-window h w i
    in let s = md-set re i (md-get re i * k) + md-set im i (md-get im i * k)
    in md-windowed re im h w (i + 1)

 The shaping: |s| ^ 2 times the picture's magnitude to the noise_q, times
 its phase.

  md-shape : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Real, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-shape (sre) (sim) (pre) (pim) (q) (i) (n) =
    if i >= n then 0
    else let a0 = real-sqrt (md-get sre i * md-get sre i + md-get sim i * md-get sim i)
    in let d = real-sqrt (md-get pre i * md-get pre i + md-get pim i * md-get pim i)
    in let a = a0 * a0 * (if q ~0 1.0 then d else sm-pow d q)
    in let s = md-set sre i (a * (md-get pre i / d)) + md-set sim i (a * (md-get pim i / d))
    in md-shape sre sim pre pim q (i + 1) n
Section: Histogram Match

 Bottom-up merge sort of an index buffer by value; stable.

  md-merge : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-merge (v) (src) (dst) (lo) (mid) (hi) (i) (j) =
    md-merge-at v src dst lo mid hi i j lo

  md-merge-at : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-merge-at (v) (src) (dst) (lo) (mid) (hi) (i) (j) (k) =
    if k >= hi then 0
    else let takeleft = i < mid & (j >= hi | md-get v (peek-32 src (i * 4)) <= md-get v (peek-32 src (j * 4)))
    in let s = poke-32 dst (k * 4) (peek-32 src ((if takeleft then i else j) * 4))
    in md-merge-at v src dst lo mid hi (if takeleft then i + 1 else i) (if takeleft then j else j + 1) (k + 1)

  md-pass : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-pass (v) (src) (dst) (width) (lo) (n) =
    if lo >= n then 0
    else let mid = if lo + width > n then n else lo + width
    in let hi = if lo + 2 * width > n then n else lo + 2 * width
    in let m = md-merge v src dst lo mid hi lo mid
    in md-pass v src dst width (lo + 2 * width) n

  md-sort-from : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-sort-from (v) (a) (b) (width) (n) =
    if width >= n then a
    else let s = md-pass v a b width 0 n
    in md-sort-from v b a (width * 2) n

  md-iota : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-iota (dst) (i) (n) = if i >= n then dst else let s = poke-32 dst (i * 4) i in md-iota dst (i + 1) n

 The template: each byte value present among the reference bytes, its
 value byte / 255 and its cumulative count over the total.

  md-byte-counts : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, List Integer -> List Integer
  md-byte-counts (bytes) (keep) (c) (i) (n) (acc) =
    if i >= n then acc
    else let k = peek-byte bytes (i * 3 + c)
    in let u = if peek-byte keep i == 1 then list-set-at acc k (list-at acc k + 1) else acc
    in md-byte-counts bytes keep c (i + 1) n acc

  md-zeros : Integer, List Integer -> List Integer
  md-zeros (n) (acc) = if n <= 0 then acc else md-zeros (n - 1) (list-push acc 0)

  Tmpl = record {
    tp-x : List Real,
    tp-y : List Real
  }

  md-template : List Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, List Real, List Real -> Tmpl
  md-template (counts) (total) (k) (cum) (xs) (ys) =
    if k >= 256 then Tmpl { tp-x = xs, tp-y = ys }
    else if list-at counts k == 0 then md-template counts total (k + 1) cum xs ys
    else let c = cum + list-at counts k
    in md-template counts total (k + 1) c (list-push xs (real-from-int c / real-from-int total)) (list-push ys (real-from-int k / 255.0))

 np.interp (numpy 1.26 arr_interp) of x over the template.

  md-search : List Real, Real, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-search (xs) (x) (lo) (hi) =
    if hi - lo <= 1 then lo
    else let mid = (lo + hi) / 2
    in if list-at xs mid <= x then md-search xs x mid hi else md-search xs x lo mid

  md-interp : Tmpl, Real -> Real
  md-interp (t) (x) =
    let n = list-length (t.tp-x)
    in if x < list-at (t.tp-x) 0 then list-at (t.tp-y) 0
    else if x > list-at (t.tp-x) (n - 1) then list-at (t.tp-y) (n - 1)
    else let j = md-search (t.tp-x) x 0 n
    in if j == n - 1 | list-at (t.tp-x) j ~0 x then list-at (t.tp-y) j
    else (list-at (t.tp-y) (j + 1) - list-at (t.tp-y) j) / (list-at (t.tp-x) (j + 1) - list-at (t.tp-x) j) * (x - list-at (t.tp-x) j) + list-at (t.tp-y) j

 The sorted source values in groups of equal value: each group's
 cumulative count over the size, interpolated, written to its members.

  md-groups : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Tmpl, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-groups (v) (order) (out) (n) (t) (i) (cum) =
    if i >= n then 0
    else let x = md-get v (peek-32 order (i * 4))
    in let e = md-group-end v order n x (i + 1)
    in let y = md-interp t (real-from-int (cum + e - i) / real-from-int n)
    in let w = md-group-put order out y i e
    in md-groups v order out n t e (cum + e - i)

  md-group-end : Integer, Integer, Integer, Real, Integer -> Integer
  md-group-end (v) (order) (n) (x) (i) = if i >= n then n else if md-get v (peek-32 order (i * 4)) ~0 x then md-group-end v order n x (i + 1) else i

  md-group-put : Integer, Integer, Real, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-group-put (order) (out) (y) (i) (e) = if i >= e then 0 else let s = md-set out (peek-32 order (i * 4)) y in md-group-put order out y (i + 1) e

Section: Matched Noise

  md-each3 : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-each3 (dst) (plane) (c) (n) = md-each3-at dst plane c 0 n

  md-each3-at : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-each3-at (dst) (plane) (c) (i) (n) = if i >= n then dst else let s = md-set dst (i * 3 + c) (md-get plane i) in md-each3-at dst plane c (i + 1) n

  md-max : Integer, Integer, Integer, Real -> Real
  md-max (a) (i) (n) (acc) = if i >= n then acc else md-max a (i + 1) n (if md-get a i > acc then md-get a i else acc)

  md-min : Integer, Integer, Integer, Real -> Real
  md-min (a) (i) (n) (acc) = if i >= n then acc else md-min a (i + 1) n (if md-get a i < acc then md-get a i else acc)

  md-sum-all : Integer, Integer, Integer, Real -> Real
  md-sum-all (a) (i) (n) (acc) = if i >= n then acc else md-sum-all a (i + 1) n (acc + md-get a i)

  md-affine : Integer, Real, Real, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-affine (a) (mul) (add) (i) (n) = if i >= n then a else let s = md-set a i (md-get a i * mul + add) in md-affine a mul add (i + 1) n

 The windowed picture: the unmasked part over its maximum, the masked part the
 picture's mean.

  md-src-window : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-src-window (src) (mask) (n) =
    let w = md-new n
    in let a = md-mul-rest src mask w 0 n
    in let mx = md-max w 0 n 0.0
    in let avg = md-sum-all src 0 n 0.0 / real-from-int n
    in md-add-mean w mask mx avg 0 n

  md-mul-rest : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-mul-rest (src) (mask) (dst) (i) (n) = if i >= n then dst else let s = md-set dst i (md-get src i * (1.0 - md-get mask i)) in md-mul-rest src mask dst (i + 1) n

  md-add-mean : Integer, Integer, Real, Real, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-add-mean (w) (mask) (mx) (avg) (i) (n) = if i >= n then w else let s = md-set w i (md-get w i / mx + avg * md-get mask i) in md-add-mean w mask mx avg (i + 1) n

 One channel's shaped noise: its noise plane windowed, back, forward again
 and shaped by the picture's transform, back to real.

  md-channel : Fft2, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Real -> Integer
  md-channel (f) (h) (w) (win) (nz) (c) (q) =
    let n = h * w
    in let zero = md-fill (md-new n) 0.0 0 n
    in let p = md-shifted-fft2 f False (md-plane win c n) zero h w
    in let s1 = md-shifted-fft2 f False (md-plane nz c n) (md-fill (md-new n) 0.0 0 n) h w
    in let s2 = md-windowed (list-at s1 0) (list-at s1 1) h w 0
    in let back = md-shifted-fft2 f True (list-at s1 0) (list-at s1 1) h w
    in let s3 = md-shifted-fft2 f False (list-at back 0) (md-fill (md-new n) 0.0 0 n) h w
    in let sh = md-shape (list-at s3 0) (list-at s3 1) (list-at p 0) (list-at p 1) q 0 n
    in list-at (md-shifted-fft2 f True (list-at s3 0) (list-at s3 1) h w) 0

 get_matched_noise over src and mask (H x W x 3 f64, the mask 0 or 1, equal
 across channels) and the picture's bytes; the result as fresh f64.

  matched-noise : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Real, Real -> Integer
  matched-noise (src) (mask) (bytes) (h) (w) (q) (cv) =
    let n = h * w
    in let f = md-fft2-for h w
    in let win = md-src-window src mask (n * 3)
    in let nz = md-tint (md-draws (pcg-seeded 0) (md-new (n * 3)) 0 (n * 3)) cv 0 n
    in let out = md-new (n * 3)
    in let c0 = md-each3 out (md-channel f h w win nz 0 q) 0 n
    in let c1 = md-each3 out (md-channel f h w win nz 1 q) 1 n
    in let c2 = md-each3 out (md-channel f h w win nz 2 q) 2 n
    in let lo = md-min out 0 (n * 3) (md-get out 0)
    in let s = md-affine out 1.0 (0.0 - lo) 0 (n * 3)
    in let hi = md-max out 0 (n * 3) (md-get out 0)
    in let t = md-affine out (1.0 / hi) 0.0 0 (n * 3)
    in md-finish src mask bytes out n

  md-flags : Integer, Integer, Boolean, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-flags (mask) (dst) (fill) (i) (n) =
    if i >= n then dst
    else let g = (md-get mask (i * 3) + md-get mask (i * 3 + 1) + md-get mask (i * 3 + 2)) / 3.0
    in let s = poke-byte dst i (if fill then (if g > 0.000001 then 1 else 0) else (if g < 0.001 then 1 else 0))
    in md-flags mask dst fill (i + 1) n

  md-pick : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-pick (vals) (keep) (c) (dst) (i) (n) (k) =
    if i >= n then k
    else if peek-byte keep i == 1 then (let s = md-set dst k (md-get vals (i * 3 + c)) in md-pick vals keep c dst (i + 1) n (k + 1))
    else md-pick vals keep c dst (i + 1) n k

  md-drop : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-drop (vals) (keep) (c) (src) (i) (n) (k) =
    if i >= n then k
    else if peek-byte keep i == 1 then (let s = md-set vals (i * 3 + c) (md-get src k) in md-drop vals keep c src (i + 1) n (k + 1))
    else md-drop vals keep c src (i + 1) n k

  md-match-channel : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-match-channel (out) (bytes) (fillm) (refm) (c) (n) =
    let v = md-new n
    in let m = md-pick out fillm c v 0 n 0
    in if m == 0 then 0
    else let counts = md-byte-counts bytes refm c 0 n (md-zeros 256 [])
    in let total = md-sum-counts counts 0 0
    in if total == 0 then 0
    else let order = md-sort-from v (md-iota (alloc-bytes (m * 4)) 0 m) (alloc-bytes (m * 4)) 1 m
    in let matched = md-new m
    in let g = md-groups v order matched m (md-template counts total 0 0 [] []) 0 0
    in md-drop out fillm c matched 0 n 0

  md-sum-counts : List Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-sum-counts (xs) (i) (acc) = if i >= list-length xs then acc else md-sum-counts xs (i + 1) (acc + list-at xs i)

  md-finish : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-finish (src) (mask) (bytes) (out) (n) =
    let fillm = md-flags mask (alloc-bytes n) True 0 n
    in let refm = md-flags mask (alloc-bytes n) False 0 n
    in let a = md-match-channel out bytes fillm refm 0 n
    in let b = md-match-channel out bytes fillm refm 1 n
    in let c = md-match-channel out bytes fillm refm 2 n
    in md-blend src mask out 0 (n * 3)

  md-blend : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  md-blend (src) (mask) (out) (i) (n) =
    if i >= n then out
    else let v = md-get src i * (1.0 - md-get mask i) + md-get out i * md-get mask i
    in let s = md-set out i (if v < 0.0 then 0.0 else if v > 1.0 then 1.0 else v)
    in md-blend src mask out (i + 1) n